        "level": 2,
        "text": "1. Audit Methodology & Clean-Room Standard (Craft Anything)"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413999174000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "In strict adherence to the [AGENTS.md](../AGENTS.md#L35-L43) ecosystem regulations, StatCraft is developed under an absolute Clean-Room clean-room standard:\n* Decompilation or direct extraction of proprietary IBM SPSS binaries or code is strictly prohibited.\n* Algorithms, mathematical formulations, and operational behaviors are reproduced exclusively from open academic literature, published textbooks, and official algorithm specifications (*IBM SPSS Statistics Algorithms*).\n* Automated verification, evidence ledgers, hypothesis tracking, and invariant validation are driven by the specialized **[Craft Anything](https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything)** MCP server operating in `clean-room: true` mode."
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413999175700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Craft Anything Evidence-Backed Investigation Architecture"
      },
