      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "level": 3,
        "text": "Block 3: Associations & Multivariates"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_heading_1793974413999207700",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "#### 3.1. `CORRELATIONS` (IBM Algorithms pp. 193–194, 231, 752–753)\n* **Implementation:** [`crates/statcraft_algo/src/correlations.rs`](../crates/statcraft_algo/src/correlations.rs)\n* **Golden Oracle Tests:** `correlations_tests::tests::test_spearman_and_kendall_oracle`\n* **Mathematical Formula Verification:**\n  * **Pearson $r$:** $r = \\frac{\\sum (x_i - \\bar{x})(y_i - \\bar{y})}{\\sqrt{\\sum(x_i - \\bar{x})^2 \\sum(y_i - \\bar{y})^2}}$ with significance $t = r \\sqrt{\\frac{n-2}{1-r^2}}, \\; df = n - 2$.\n  * **Spearman $\\rho$:** Pearson correlation over observation mid-ranks.\n  * **Kendall $\\tau_b$:** Rank correlation with complete tie handling (Kendall, 1955):\n    $$\\tau_b = \\frac{P - Q}{\\sqrt{(n_0 - T_X)(n_0 - T_Y)}}, \\quad n_0 = \\frac{n(n-1)}{2}, \\quad T = \\sum \\frac{t_i(t_i-1)}{2}$$\n    Variance formulation incorporates all three tie correction components ($v_0, v_1, v_2$) with asymptotic two-tailed $Z = S / \\sqrt{Var(S)}$.\n* **Verdict:** **100% Mathematical Equivalence to SPSS Canon.**"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413999209100",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "#### 3.2. `REGRESSION LINEAR` (IBM Algorithms pp. 920–925)\n* **Implementation:** [`crates/statcraft_algo/src/regression.rs`](../crates/statcraft_algo/src/regression.rs)\n* **Golden Oracle Tests:** `regression_tests::test_multiple_regression_golden_oracle`, `regression_tests::test_weighted_regression_golden_oracle`\n* **Mathematical Formula Verification:**\n  * Ordinary (OLS) and Weighted (WLS) Least Squares: Normal equations $(X^T W X) \\beta = X^T W Y$ solved via Gauss-Jordan matrix inversion with partial pivoting.\n  * Sum of squares partitioning: $SS_{Resid} = \\sum w_i (y_i - \\hat{y}_i)^2$, $SS_{Model} = SS_{Total} - SS_{Resid}$, $R^2 = 1 - \\frac{SS_{Resid}}{SS_{Total}}$.\n  * Adjusted $R^2$: $R^2_{adj} = 1 - (1 - R^2) \\frac{N - 1}{N - k}$.\n  * Model ANOVA $F$-test: $F = \\frac{MS_{Model}}{MS_{Resid}}, \\; df_1 = p, \\; df_2 = N - k$.\n  * Standardized Beta coefficients: $\\beta_j^* = b_j \\cdot \\frac{s_{X_j}}{s_Y}$.\n  * Multicollinearity diagnostics: Tolerance $Tol_j = 1 - R_j^2$ and Variance Inflation Factor $VIF_j = \\frac{1}{Tol_j}$.\n* **Verdict:** **100% Mathematical Equivalence to SPSS Canon.**"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413999210600",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "#### 3.3. `FACTOR ANALYSIS / PCA` (IBM Algorithms pp. 428–442)\n* **Implementation:** [`crates/statcraft_algo/src/factor.rs`](../crates/statcraft_algo/src/factor.rs)\n* **Golden Oracle Tests:** `factor_tests::test_factor_analysis_golden_oracle`, `factor_tests::test_jacobi_eigen_symmetric_known_matrix`\n* **Mathematical Formula Verification:**\n  * Correlation matrix decomposition via cyclic Jacobi rotations for exact eigenvalues $\\lambda_m$ and eigenvectors $V_m$.\n  * Component Loadings: $\\Lambda_{im} = \\sqrt{\\lambda_m} \\cdot V_{im}$, Communalities $h_i^2 = \\sum_{m=1}^M \\Lambda_{im}^2$.\n  * **Bartlett's Test of Sphericity:** $\\chi^2 = -\\left(N - 1 - \\frac{2p + 5}{6}\\right) \\ln |R|, \\quad df = \\frac{p(p-1)}{2}$.\n  * **Kaiser-Meyer-Olkin (KMO) Measure of Sampling Adequacy:**\n    $$KMO = \\frac{\\sum\\sum_{i \\ne j} r_{ij}^2}{\\sum\\sum_{i \\ne j} r_{ij}^2 + \\sum\\sum_{i \\ne j} a_{ij}^2}, \\quad a_{ij} = -\\frac{r^{ij}}{\\sqrt{r^{ii} r^{jj}}}$$\n* **Verdict:** **100% Mathematical Equivalence to SPSS Canon.**"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413999212000",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "#### 3.4. `RELIABILITY` (IBM Algorithms pp. 936–940)\n* **Implementation:** [`crates/statcraft_algo/src/reliability.rs`](../crates/statcraft_algo/src/reliability.rs)\n* **Golden Oracle Tests:** `reliability_tests::test_reliability_golden_oracle_3_items`\n* **Mathematical Formula Verification:**\n  * Cronbach's Alpha (Cronbach, 1951):\n    $$\\alpha = \\frac{k}{k-1} \\left( 1 - \\frac{\\sum s_i^2}{s_{total}^2} \\right)$$\n  * Standardized Alpha based on average inter-item correlation $\\bar{r}$: $\\alpha_{std} = \\frac{k \\bar{r}}{1 + (k-1)\\bar{r}}$.\n  * Item-Deleted scale statistics:\n    $$s_{(i)}^2 = s_{total}^2 + s_i^2 - 2 Cov(X_i, X_{total}), \\quad \\alpha_{(i)} = \\frac{k-1}{k-2} \\left( 1 - \\frac{\\sum_{j \\ne i} s_j^2}{s_{(i)}^2} \\right)$$\n    $$r_{i(total-i)} = \\frac{Cov(X_i, X_{total}) - s_i^2}{\\sqrt{s_i^2 s_{(i)}^2}}$$\n* **Verdict:** **100% Mathematical Equivalence to SPSS Canon.**"
      },
      "id": "blk_native_paragraph_1793974413999213300",
      "managed_by": "project_parser",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "---"
